{
  "rules": [
    "You are helping write a novel called 'Walk This Way'",
    "Genre: Coming-of-age fiction with musical themes",
    "Setting: Boston area, spanning from middle school through high school years",
    "Main characters:",
    "  - Nick: Musician, garage band member, from working-class background",
    "  - Jackie: From wealthy family ('gilded cage'), close friend of Nick",
    "  - Maxanne: Talented singer, central to the story's musical elements",
    "  - Patty: Returns later in the story, significant character",
    "  - Grace: Character who 'loses her grace', part of the friendship dynamics",
    "  - Dan: Character who dies, pivotal event in the story",
    "",
    "Key themes:",
    "  - Friendship dynamics and how they change over time",
    "  - Music as a driving force in relationships",
    "  - Class differences and social dynamics",
    "  - Coming of age and identity formation",
    "  - The power and impact of talent shows and musical performances",
    "",
    "Story structure:",
    "  - Act I: Middle school years, friendship formation, early musical experiences",
    "  - Act II: High school years, growing tensions, talent shows and competitions",
    "  - Act III: Climactic battle of the bands, resolution of conflicts",
    "",
    "Writing style preferences:",
    "  - Authentic, character-driven prose",
    "  - Nostalgic tone reflecting on formative years",
    "  - Focus on emotional authenticity over plot mechanics",
    "  - Musical scenes should feel vivid and immersive",
    "  - Dialogue should reflect the age and background of each character",
    "",
    "When providing writing assistance:",
    "  - Maintain consistency with established character voices",
    "  - Keep musical references authentic to the Boston rock scene",
    "  - Preserve the nostalgic, coming-of-age atmosphere",
    "  - Ensure dialogue matches the time period and character backgrounds",
    "  - Help develop emotional authenticity in key scenes",
    "",
    "Context awareness:",
    "  - Remember character relationships and dynamics",
    "  - Track the progression from middle school to high school",
    "  - Maintain consistency with the three-act structure",
    "  - Keep musical elements central to the story's emotional core"
  ]
}
